# Mechanic: battlefield Mycosynth Golem grants affinity to a different artifact creature.
# Forcing: two artifacts reduce Juggernaut from four generic to two, exactly the available mana.
# AI behavior: no hand or battlefield, so no opposing choices affect payment.
# Failure modes: missing offer rejects the reduced-cost cast; wrong payment or a hang fails the probe.
# Card roles: Golem grants affinity, Ornithopter fixes the artifact count, Juggernaut consumes mana.
# Protocol path: Cast offer and response, ManaPaid, battlefield resolution, then continued land play.
# Paired with: affinity-without-golem.pzl and affinity-without-golem-payable.pzl.
[metadata]
Name:Granted artifact affinity
Goal:Survive
Turns:5
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Juggernaut for two mana with two artifacts, then play Forest.
